                  </p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p className="mt-8 border-mn-rule border-t pt-5 text-[0.8125rem] text-mn-graphite leading-[1.6]">
              The memos stay, because the rest of the meeting still happened.
              The person is gone from them.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>
  );
}

